    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n7132" root="حجأ" body-key="H">
    
      1 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حَجَأَبِهِ</span></b> , aor. 
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حَجَاَ</span></b> , <i>He rejoiced in it,</i> or <i>at it;</i>
namely, a thing, or an affair or event; (S, K;)
as also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حَجِىءَ به</span>, aor. 
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حَجَاَ</span></b> : (K:) or the latter, <i>he
was,</i> or <i>became, attached to it, and tenacious of
it;</i> (S, K;) as also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حَجِىَ به</span>, without <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ء</span>; and
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">به</span> ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تحجّأ</span></b> : (S:) or <i>he laid,</i> or <i>kept, hold upon
it, and clave to it;</i> (Fr, K;) as also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حَجِىَ به</span>,
without <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ء</span>; (Fr;) and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حَجَأَبه</span>, (TA,) and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تحجّأ</span></b> 
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">به</span>. (Fr, K.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حَجَأَ عَنْهُ كذَا</span>, aor. 
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حَجَاَ</span></b> , <i>He kept,</i>
or <i>withheld, from him such a thing.</i> (K.)

